7	#   C (bug):        buggy_app bug &   -> expect stalled + (after M2/M4) recovery
8	#
9	# Usage:
10	#   python3 scenario.py --scenario A --logfile out.log
11	#   python3 scenario.py --scenario A --rounds 10 --json out.jsonl
12	#
13	# The verdict is parsed from the board log only ("先有日志、再下结论"):
14	#   PASS requires [trace] END status=ok AND (for A) no recover_task calls.
15	#   Network/LLM failures are counted separately (net_fail), not as scenario fails.
